Task 1 - Script explaination 

      a = int(input("Enter a integer value: "))
      if a % 2 == 0:
          print(a, "is an even number.")
      else:
          print(a, "is an odd number.")
      
      
      The above script allows user to input a integer (a is defined in the code as "int" to accepts interger values alone). 
